# Trim the build context. The Dockerfile copies the source tree with one
# `COPY . /gltron/`, and the cmake build + ctest run right after it, so every path
# here is one whose edits must NOT rebuild the game: it is not part of the build.
# Patterns are anchored at the context root (unlike .gitignore).

# VCS metadata and agent state.
.git
.gitattributes
.gitignore
.dockerignore
.claude
.crush
CLAUDE.md

# Container plumbing: the Makefile mounts the vendored .emacs.d (elpa/) and the
# entrypoint scripts at run time. The three files the Dockerfile's earlier COPYs name
# are re-included (an excluded path cannot be COPYed); they also land in /gltron/,
# which costs nothing, since a change to them already re-runs every later layer.
Dockerfile
Makefile
entrypoint
!entrypoint/01-install-base.sh
!entrypoint/02-install-graphics.sh
!entrypoint/dotfiles/.emacs.d/install-melpa-packages.el

# Task docs.
tasks

# Out-of-tree build directories and image-export tarballs (see .gitignore).
bld
bld-appimage
out
*.tar
